{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Kindergarten is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 15 different educational activities, Arthur's Kindergarten teaches a full year's worth of kindergarten skills and entertains your child with limitless fun and learning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activity Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create music and greeting cards. Or, print puzzles, games and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Counting &amp; Sorting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice counting and sorting money with Arthur and Buster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the learning activities to unlock 3 fun reward activities!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhyming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letter Recognition &amp; Sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arithmetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counting &amp; Sorting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sizes &amp; Shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts &amp; Crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing &amp; Coloring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns &amp; Sequencing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic &amp; Problem Solving</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Leveling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Help Messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printable Activities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056580?t=1761296979","background_raw":"https://shared